### Component Details

| Component | Backend | Model | Role |
|-----------|---------|-------|------|
| **Primary** | Anthropic Direct | `claude-opus-4-5-20251101` | Orchestrator (NO coding) |
| **Worker-Heavy** | Azure AI Foundry | `claude-opus-4-5-20251101` | Complex tasks (T2+): code gen, tests, files |
| **Worker-Lite** | Local | `deepseek-coder-v2-lite-instruct` | Simple tasks (T1): search, format, navigate |
| **Validator** | Azure AI Foundry | `claude-sonnet-4-5` | Decision validation (>0.7 confidence) |
| **Friend** | Azure OpenAI | `gpt-4o` | Rules/CLAUDE.md guardian |
| **Critic** | Azure OpenAI | `gpt-5.1-codex-mini` | Quality gate (≥80% viability) |

### Worker Routing

| Task Type | Worker | Tier | MCP Server |
|-----------|--------|------|------------|
| Code generation | Worker-Heavy | T3 | `secondary-claude` |
| Test execution | Worker-Heavy | T3 | `secondary-claude` |
| File operations | Worker-Heavy | T3 | `secondary-claude` |
| Research/exploration | Worker-Heavy | T3 | `secondary-claude` |
| File search/glob | Worker-Lite | T1 | `tertiary-claude-lite` |
| Simple formatting | Worker-Lite | T1 | `tertiary-claude-lite` |
| Code navigation | Worker-Lite | T1 | `tertiary-claude-lite` |
| Syntax validation | Worker-Lite | T1 | `tertiary-claude-lite` |

**Fallback**: If Worker-Lite is unavailable (local model not running), tasks automatically route to Worker-Heavy.

